TerraGraph is original work. It takes design ideas from Kyber-Weave's DocGraph
(https://github.com/dpalfery/kyber-weave) — the immutable in-memory snapshot,
ranking on declared identity, the relevance floor, the character budget — but no
code: Kyber-Weave is C# and TerraGraph is Go. Nothing is vendored from it.


